[en.IDEA_ERA_HYGIENE_3_CLEAN]
Clean Environment

[en.IDEA_ERA_HYGIENE_3_CLEAN_desc]
“Cleanliness is next to Celestialness.” — Nurse Redheart
§g“Shall we change that slogan now?”§!
“Oh right, Coziness, I guess.”

