[en.IDEA_ERA_HYGIENE_4_NORMAL]
Normal State

[en.IDEA_ERA_HYGIENE_4_NORMAL_desc]
“An apple a day, keeps the doctor away. Remember, it must be an apple.” — Granny Smith

[en.IDEA_ERA_HYGIENE_4_NORMAL_TOOLTIP]
Base Disease outbreak and transmission risk factor §Y100%§!.

[en.IDEA_ERA_HYGIENE_5_DIRTY]
Medical Chaos

[en.IDEA_ERA_HYGIENE_5_DIRTY_desc]
“This is one of the best run hospital.”
§g“But there are no patients?!”§!
“Of course, this is the the most hygienic hospital.”

[en.IDEA_ERA_HYGIENE_5_DIRTY_TOOLTIP]
Base Disease outbreak and transmission risk factor §Y125%§!.

[en.IDEA_ERA_HYGIENE_6_FILTHY]
“Casual Mode”

[en.IDEA_ERA_HYGIENE_6_FILTHY_desc]
Casual Mode
· No one washes their hooves
 · Research doctors don’t work
 · Sick ponies given hugs

[en.IDEA_ERA_HYGIENE_6_FILTHY_TOOLTIP]
